{
  "id": "p37",
  "title": "The Ski School on the Hill",
  "titleZh": "山上的滑雪学校",
  "topic": "山区滑雪学校",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "The ski school matters in this cold mountain province.",
        "zh": "这所滑雪学校在这片寒冷的山区省份很重要。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A refugee family from another nation saves every spare yen.",
        "zh": "一个来自另一个国家的难民家庭省下每一分闲钱。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A female champion and a young runner lead the school.",
        "zh": "一位女冠军和一位年轻跑者带领这所学校。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Cheap local material and a simple function suit the small hut.",
        "zh": "便宜的本地材料和简单的功能很适合这间小屋。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My notes admit the whole scene looks rough at dawn.",
        "zh": "我的笔记承认，黎明时整个场景看起来很粗糙。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A quiet school reform brings a new colleague from the city.",
        "zh": "一场安静的学校改革从城里带来一位新同事。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Lessons are extremely cheap, so the teachers earn very little.",
        "zh": "课程极其便宜，所以老师们挣得很少。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A kind donor helps them purchase boots and a photo album.",
        "zh": "一位好心捐助者帮他们购买了靴子和一本相册。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They employ two young local guides at a reasonable daily rate.",
        "zh": "他们以合理的日薪雇用两名年轻的本地向导。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The theme is courage, and they attach it to every lesson.",
        "zh": "主题是勇气，他们把它附加在每一节课上。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A human being can do much when the result is unknown.",
        "zh": "当结果未知时，一个人能做的很多。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They preserve the old wooden boards with maximum care.",
        "zh": "他们用最大的小心保存旧木板。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My gentle tip helps a nervous child stand on the snow.",
        "zh": "我温和的提示帮助一个紧张的孩子在雪上站起来。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Warm leather boots protect small feet from harm.",
        "zh": "温暖的皮靴保护小脚免受伤害。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A painful fall teaches the small ones how to float safely.",
        "zh": "一次痛苦的摔倒教会小家伙们如何安全地漂浮。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Their cautious coach is a strong advocate of slow steps.",
        "zh": "他们谨慎的教练是慢步骤的坚定倡导者。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then, despite the cold wind, the first race reveals real talent.",
        "zh": "然后，尽管有冷风，第一场比赛显露出真正的天赋。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Their only weapon is warm laughter, largely shared by all.",
        "zh": "他们唯一的武器是温暖的笑声，很大程度上大家共有。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A firm resolution normally helps a team through winter.",
        "zh": "坚定的决心通常能帮一个团队度过冬天。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Surely this hard phase will end with the warm spring.",
        "zh": "这个艰难的阶段一定会随着温暖的春天结束。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "My mother's negative test and warm protein soup help.",
        "zh": "我母亲的阴性检测和热蛋白汤有帮助。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A mere half hour of practice can enhance balance.",
        "zh": "仅仅半小时的练习就能增强平衡。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They entitle each child to a free lesson and wrap small gifts.",
        "zh": "他们让每个孩子都有免费课程，并包好小礼物。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later an unexpected stroke leaves the old coach very weak.",
        "zh": "后来一次意外的中风让老教练非常虚弱。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A short retreat follows, and a new segment begins.",
        "zh": "短暂的退修之后，新的阶段开始了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Helpers tackle the steep path and provoke loud happy cheers.",
        "zh": "帮手们应对陡峭的小路，激起响亮的欢呼。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The overwhelming support is noted in every local paper.",
        "zh": "铺天盖地的支持被当地每家报纸记录下来。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then the lost child is found, and all are accepted home.",
        "zh": "然后走失的孩子被找到，所有人都被接纳回家。"
      }
    ]
  ],
